--- !u!114 &5151826383245976730
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3972055758679815465}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9dc8b0a49b01426a86ac8c5d1a9cdf0a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestFlight.Product.ProductDemoNarration
  modes: {fileID: 6406045178022147876}
  pilot: {fileID: 5025774026687160251}
  flight: {fileID: 742791276885309778}
  pilotCamera: {fileID: 3067436957052443886}
  voice: {fileID: 8487570425855855926}
  captionRoot: {fileID: 3396580306968058622}
  instruction: {fileID: 52594897756540756}
  cues:
  - id: tour_intro
    text: Welcome aboard. I'll fly us around Boulder and bring us back to land. Menu
      pauses the flight. Choose Take control whenever you want to fly.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec6acacc924e7c24a92d491e07a91d7d, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_your_controls
    text: You have the controls. Choose Let the demo fly from the pause menu when
      you're ready to hand back.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cd87c3f69502def41a8a45f95a6ed61f, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_my_controls
    text: I've got the controls. I'll settle the airplane and rejoin the route ahead.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a34c0366009ac374c8d03fb614975c0b, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_final
    text: We're on final approach. I'll keep the runway centered and settle the airplane
      onto the main wheels.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4b45ce93de522cc49894bc3638282187, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_goaround
    text: This approach isn't settled. I'll climb away and try again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53a1e672f7f4421458671f61f1279bb3, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_exit
    text: We're on the ground. I'll slow down and follow the taxiway clear of the
      runway.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 68eeb05b2f166664c90ca54908f30d26, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_complete
    text: We're clear of the runway and stopped. Thanks for flying with me. Open
      Menu to choose another flight or try a lesson.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b338b689985964e4e918a42aa4650b2b, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
    distance: 0
  - id: tour_reservoir
    text: Boulder Reservoir is a recreation area and part of the city's water supply.
      It makes a useful landmark when finding the airport.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1e66e8c35d1f15447845e31a2752eb67, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 250, y: 20, z: 4308}
    distance: 3500
  - id: tour_flatirons
    text: Those sloping rock faces along the foothills are the Flatirons. We're staying
      east of the rising terrain to enjoy the view with room to maneuver.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8716bbfb96dbecd4d8d3308e5c217dd3, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: -6500, y: 650, z: -4600}
    distance: 8500
  - id: tour_east_boulder
    text: From here you can look across eastern Boulder toward the mountains. In
      a small airplane, most of your attention belongs outside, with brief checks
      of the instruments.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 30c8ae12bf8bd274f90adde720806624, type: 3}
    landmark: {x: 900, y: 30, z: -2300}
    distance: 3800
  - id: tour_eagle_left
    text: Golden eagle ahead, slightly left.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1297e93424f5d4f4daac7616861b4616, type: 3}
